erp-consent-tags-tab = Consent
erp-consent-tags-header = Consent tags
erp-consent-tags-hint = Hover a tag to see what it allows. Changing a tag away from "Yes" during a scene it covers is not allowed.
erp-consent-tags-requires = Requires "{$tag}" to be set to "Yes".
erp-consent-tags-examine-header = Character preferences

erp-consent-option-Yes = Yes
erp-consent-option-Ask = Ask
erp-consent-option-No = No

erp-consent-tag-erp-name = Erotic roleplay
erp-consent-tag-erp-desc = Erotic interactions and roleplay.

erp-consent-tag-rape-name = Rape
erp-consent-tag-rape-desc = No - sexual violence against the character is forbidden, including using sex toys and ERP reagents without separate OOC consent.
    Ask - consent to forced ERP actions, with the right to stop the scene in LOOC. Sex toys only with separate OOC consent.
    Yes - automatic consent to sexual violence against the character.
    With No/Ask, lewd emotes and verbs need OOC consent. Brainwashing and silicon laws do not replace consent.

erp-consent-tag-vore-name = Eating/Swallowing
erp-consent-tag-vore-desc = Being eaten and digested.

erp-consent-tag-mob-sex-name = Sex with mobs
erp-consent-tag-mob-sex-desc = Special mobs will try to assault you.

erp-consent-tag-horny-antag-name = Horny antag victim
erp-consent-tag-horny-antag-desc = Antagonists with ERP objectives can pick your character as their victim.

erp-consent-tag-dirty-sex-name = Dirty sex
erp-consent-tag-dirty-sex-desc = Ordinary dirt from clothes, surroundings and so on.

erp-consent-tag-very-dirty-sex-name = Very dirty sex
erp-consent-tag-very-dirty-sex-desc = All other bodily discharges besides the classic ones.

erp-consent-tag-brutal-sex-name = Brutal sex
erp-consent-tag-brutal-sex-desc = Choking, biting, roughness, semi-rape and so on.

erp-consent-tag-very-brutal-sex-name = Very brutal sex
erp-consent-tag-very-brutal-sex-desc = All other places of penetration besides the classic ones, brutal scenes with real harm up to and including death.

erp-consent-tag-tattoo-name = Tattoo
erp-consent-tag-tattoo-desc = Other players can leave tattoos on you.
